+"""S2 evaluation runner: plan-select (train-only), capped dev eval, one-shot final.
+
+Backend-agnostic planning protocol; pure CPU / NumPy. Zero MLX imports.
+Specifications per reports/V9-S2-DESIGN/DESIGN-r2.md §4, §5, §7.
+"""
+
